        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur NEWBEL, Bellagio Lever with Newport Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe elegant styling of the Bellagio Wave Lever With Newport Rose makes it universally appealing for a wide variety of office or home styles. Unencumbered by complexity, this traditional design is much sought after in decorative door hardware. The wave lever is forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware and the matching Newport Rope Rose gives this entry set a clean design suitable for a wide array of decor applications from traditional to historic to contemporary. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-newport-series\"><b>Newport Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur NEWBEL Newport Rosette with Bellagio Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bellagio Wave Lever with Rope Newport Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Newport Rosette Diameter: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Bellagio Lever Length: 4.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Bellagio Lever Projection: 1.90\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/NEW-rose.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Newport Rosette Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BEL-lever.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Bellagio Lever Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Bellagio Wave Lever With Newport Rosette",
                "description": "Grandeur NEWBEL, Bellagio Wave Lever With Newport Rose - The elegant styling of the Bellagio Wave Lever With Newport Rose makes for universally appealing in a wide variety of office or home styles. Unencumbered by complexity, this traditional design is much sought after in decorative door hardware. The wave lever is forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware and the matching Newport Rope Rose gives this entry set a clean design suitable for a wide array of decor applications from traditional to historic to contemporary. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Grandeur Newport Rosette With Bellagio Levers, Bellagio Door Levers, Grandeur door levers, Grandeur Newport series, Grandeur NEWBEL, Newport Rosette With Bellagio Levers, classic door levers, GRA-NEWBEL, Newport Rose With Bellagio Door Levers, wave levers, Bellagio Wave Lever With Newport Rosettes, Bellagio Wave Lever With Newport Roses, Newport Rosette with Bellagio Levers,"
